{
  "meta": {
    "slug": "transaction",
    "title": "Transaction：客户端提交 → SF 排队 → 按序应用",
    "subtitle": "从 app 侧 SurfaceComposerClient::Transaction 收集 layer 状态，merge 与 buffer 缓存，到 SF 侧 setTransactionState 做权限净化、入无锁队列，TransactionHandler 用 ready 过滤器与 barrier 保证顺序，最后 applyTransactionState 写入 drawing state",
    "version": "android17-release",
    "built": "2026-11-26",
    "git_ref": "24bc82b5d",
    "repo": "AOSP_Frameworks",
    "summary": "只讲 Transaction 这一条：客户端 Transaction 对象累积 layer_state_t/DisplayState，merge() 合并同批变更并对被覆盖的 buffer 触发释放，apply() 缓存 buffer、打包成 TransactionState 走 setTransactionState binder；服务端 setTransactionState 按 uid/pid 净化权限、解析 layer 句柄、组装 QueuedTransactionState 推入无锁队列并 setTransactionFlags；SF 主线程在 commit 时 collectTransactions 归并同 applyToken 的队列，flushTransactions 依据按序过滤器链（frame timeline、buffer/barrier、barrier 超时）决定每笔能否应用；applyTransactionState 在 mStateLock 下把状态写进 LayerLifecycleManager 与 mDrawingState，并登记回调。内核 binder、vendor HAL 在仓库外。",
    "kicker": "AOSP · android17-release · SurfaceControl.Transaction"
  },
